%% KASA Core — editable diagram source (Mermaid). Extend as the design evolves.

%% ---- End-to-end interaction flow ----
flowchart LR
  HOME([HOME: big Speak button]) -->|tap/say| LISTEN[LISTEN: record audio]
  LISTEN --> UND[UNDERSTAND: server -> Intent]
  UND -->|confidence < 0.6| LISTEN
  UND --> CONF[CONFIRM: speak + show summary]
  CONF --> Q{Confirmed?}
  Q -->|No| HOME
  Q -->|Yes| EXEC[EXECUTE USSD: engine drives menus]
  EXEC --> READ[READ MENUS: TTS Twi + captions]
  READ --> PIN[PIN STEP -> HAND OFF: app pauses, user types PIN]
  PIN --> RES[RESULT: read outcome in Twi]
  RES --> REC[AUDIO RECEIPT: action logged, no PIN]
  RES --> HOME

%% ---- PIN hand-off (sequence) ----
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant APP as KASA app
  participant A11Y as Accessibility Service
  participant USSD as System USSD dialog (OS)
  participant CAR as MTN carrier
  U->>APP: approve: send GH5 to Kofi
  APP->>A11Y: execute(intent)
  A11Y->>USSD: dial *170#, inject Transfer -> recipient -> amount -> reference
  USSD->>CAR: forward steps
  CAR-->>USSD: prompt ENTER PIN
  Note over A11Y: detect PIN marker -> STOP injecting
  APP->>U: speak "enter your PIN now" + haptic
  U->>USSD: types PIN directly into system dialog
  Note over U,USSD: PIN never enters KASA (memory / network / logs)
  USSD->>CAR: PIN submitted by the carrier session
  CAR-->>USSD: Transfer successful
  A11Y->>APP: onSuccess(resultText)
  APP->>U: speak result in Twi + audio receipt
